{"unit_id":"jiujiezongheti__zen-useragent#card-zh","repo":"jiujiezongheti/zen-useragent","commit":"f0786cf7941d86b960002c1e38173151be6c72d4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-zen-useragent 是面向 DSH 的模型接入插件。它在启动时定位并补丁 DSH 的 pi-ai 请求头逻辑和 OpenAI completions 参数，使 provider 自定义请求头能送达 OpenCode Zen，并补齐所需身份信息、会话 ID、OAuth 认证及缺失的 read 工具。适合在 DSH 中使用 OpenCode Zen 免费模型的用户。需要本机已登录的 OpenCode 客户端以读取会话和令牌；首次补丁或升级后需重启 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:23-25","lib/index.js:239-284","lib/patch-core.js:364-400","lib/patch-core.js:550-570"]}
{"unit_id":"jiujiezongheti__zen-useragent#card-en","repo":"jiujiezongheti/zen-useragent","commit":"f0786cf7941d86b960002c1e38173151be6c72d4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-zen-useragent patches DSH requests to OpenCode Zen. It forwards provider headers, adds missing identity and session details, uses a local OAuth token, and supplies a missing read tool. Sign in with OpenCode and restart DSH after installation or upgrade.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:23-25","lib/index.js:239-284","lib/patch-core.js:364-400","lib/patch-core.js:550-570"]}
